          <summary>What's the process for bringing my UK driving license to Spain?</summary>
          <div class="msv__faq-answer">
            <p>Your UK driving license is valid in Spain for up to 12 months. After that, apply for a Spanish license (Permiso de Conducir) through your local traffic authority (Jefatura Provincial de Tráfico). EU/UK licenses are recognized.</p>
          </div>
        </details>
